# Normalize line endings to LF for everything text-based, regardless of the
# checking-out machine's core.autocrlf setting. Without this, every session
# that edits a file with a tool writing LF (most of them) produces a wall of
# spurious CRLF-vs-LF prettier/eslint warnings across unrelated files on the
# next lint run, and can make `npm run format` silently rewrite files that
# weren't otherwise touched.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.svg text eol=lf
